	(text "System-5 VIDEO-G 1.0 TEXT, one sheet per functional block:\n  sheet 2  Decode         BUS: MEMORY DECODE (7000-7FFF), PORT DECODE, IOCYC\n  sheet 3  CRTC + RAM     THE 6845 ON PORTS 5 / 6 AND THE IDT7134 TEXT RAM\n  sheet 4  Clock + pipeline 12 MHz DOT CLOCK, CHARACTER COUNTER, CODE LATCH, CHARACTER ROM, SHIFTER\n  sheet 5  Video out      THE TEXT / GRAPHICS COMBINE, THE SYNC BUFFERS, RCA AND DB9\n  sheet 6  Keyboard + status PS/2 KEYBOARD (ATmega328P), KEY LATCH (INP 1) AND -EF, STATUS (INP 4)\n  sheet 7  Ribbon to GFX  J6: THE 40-PIN RIBBON TO THE GFX BOARD\n  sheet 8  Power          POWER, DECOUPLING, SPARE GATES, LED\n\nRedrawn 2026-11-01 from the board netlist; proven pin for pin against it (gen_schematic.py).\n\nEvery net of a sheet is a pin of its sheet symbol here, labelled with the net's name. Above a dashed line:\nthe nets the sheet shares with other sheets (left: it reads them, right: it drives them). Below it: nets\ndrawn on that sheet only. VCC and GND are power symbols on the sheets." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c1425de6-61e1-5226-ac79-a64137f976e8"))
	(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
